CHECKLIST for releasing fastjet
-------------------------------

this file will at some point contain the checklist to be carried out
before each release. If you make a release, update the X.Y.Z numbers
to indicate you carried out the operation.

X.Y.Z  make sure version number in configure.ac is correct

X.Y.Z  generate config_win.h: cd src && ./genconfig.sh ../include/fastjet/config_win.h

X.Y.Z  ensure NEWS is up to date

X.Y.Z  make sure siscone points to a tag, not trunk

X.Y.Z  make check [how do we deal with various config options?]

X.Y.Z  make distcheck

X.Y.Z  copy distribution to web
X.Y.Z  update doxygen version number, run doxygen, copy to web
X.Y.Z  compile manual, give it current version number
X.Y.Z. copy manual to web
X.Y.Z  update main web page & menu

X.Y.Z  tag

X.Y.Z  send mail to: fastjet-announce@projects.hepforge.org
       subject: FastJet release X.Y.Z       



